{"4728350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BLIND SHIFT: Blackout Racing", "steam_appid": 4728350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DRIFT &amp; GRIP is a stylish racing experience focused on two distinct driving styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master DRIFT for aggressive slides and smoke-filled corners, or choose GRIP for precision racing and perfect control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every track rewards a different approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏁 Dual Driving Styles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between DRIFT and GRIP gameplay styles at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 Multiple Game Modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in Racing, Elimination, Drift Score, Combo Master, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚗 Car Customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and personalize your cars with visual and performance modifications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌃 Stylish Neon Environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through atmospheric city locations with cinematic neon visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Skill-Based Progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Bronze, Silver, and Gold medals while mastering every track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MASTER YOUR STYLE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some challenges reward speed and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others demand control, style, and aggressive drifting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become unstoppable.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DRIFT &amp; GRIP is a stylish racing experience focused on two distinct driving styles.